<title>USA: Hanover Foods Corp sales decrease.</title>
<headline>Hanover Foods Corp sales decrease.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Pa. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanover Foods Corp said its sales for the first eight months of 1997 decreased to $172 million from $177 million for the comparable period in 1996.</p>
<p>The company was not available to comment on any other financial results.</p>
</text>
